{"name":"Crisps","hex":"#e2bd67","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"crisps","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of crisp"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/crisps"}],"entries":[{"title":"Potato chips","blocks":[{"text":"Potato chips or crisps are thin slices of potato that have been deep-fried, baked, or air-fried until crunchy. They are commonly served as a snack, appetizer or side dish. Basic potato chips are cooked and salted; additional varieties are manufactured using various seasonings, flavorings and ingredients including herbs, spices, cheeses, other natural flavors, artificial flavors, and additives."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Potato-Chips.jpg/330px-Potato-Chips.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potato_chips","wikidata":"Q173265"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Production_of_homemade_chips_%284%29.JPG/500px-Production_of_homemade_chips_%284%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Production_of_homemade_chips_%284%29.JPG/1280px-Production_of_homemade_chips_%284%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Production_of_homemade_chips_%284%29.JPG/500px-Production_of_homemade_chips_%284%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Homemade potato slices are deep-fried in hot oil for several minutes.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AProduction_of_homemade_chips_(4).JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Old_smiths_potato_chips_ad.jpg/500px-Old_smiths_potato_chips_ad.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedi